# KiCad autosave / project state
# KiCad creates .history/ as its own embedded git repo. These must be matched
# WITHOUT a trailing slash: git checks for a nested .git first and would
# otherwise record them as gitlinks, and `git add` then fails with
# "does not have a commit checked out".
.history
kicad/.history
*.kicad_prl
fp-info-cache
*.lck

# Export scratch
*.tmp
*.bak
